1. DICOM Standard (PS3.x)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) NEMA (National Electrical Manufacturers Association).

The DICOM Standard is published by NEMA and is the ultimate origin of the
factual content here: data element tags, keywords, value representations, value
multiplicities, unique identifiers, and de-identification action codes.

This project republishes those FACTS (as reorganized data), not the Standard's
descriptive prose, figures, or tables as published. The Standard itself remains
available from NEMA at https://dicom.nema.org/.

